<title>UK: Norway's Gullfaks crude to load 23 cargoes in May.</title>
<headline>Norway's Gullfaks crude to load 23 cargoes in May.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Gullfaks crude system is scheduled to load 23 standard 855,000-barrel cargoes in May, unchanged from April, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The total volume of crude to load in May is 19.66 million barrels, unchanged from April, but daily liftings will dip to 634,000 barrels per day (bpd) from 655,000 bpd due to the longer month, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
